et=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Cunning Combo</b> is a passive feature that lets the user make additional attacks when shooting a target at close range.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you shoot a target at close range, you can make an additional melee attack against it as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>. \n</p><p>This reaction won't trigger on a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Magical Hand Crossbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Hand_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Magical Hand Crossbow\">Magical Hand Crossbow</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715113704\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 912/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9552/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2007/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip re